  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TinLink</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project focuses on strengthening of enhanced due diligence processes and their integration with existing technology solutions for data management and transfer, with the development of access to data centres to bridge the gap between downstream and upstream supply chain actors.&#xa0;The project wants to demonstrate that using blockchain technology can be implemented at mine sites in Conflict-Affected and High-Risk Areas (CAHRA&#x2019;s) and can be accessed in a secure and controlled manner by supply chain actors (from mine to consumer-facing companies), governments, and the public while fully conformant with the requirements of the Organisation for Economic Co-operation and Development (OECD), International Conference on the Great Lakes Region (ICGLR) and the Governmental regulations.</narrative>
  </description>
